sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Developer
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Server as FastAPI Server
    participant CLI as CLI Provider (Claude/OpenCode)

    User->>Browser: Click chat toggle button (bottom-right)
    Note over Browser: Panel slides out, page reflows to 60/40 split

    Browser->>Server: GET /api/providers
    alt No providers configured
        Server-->>Browser: Empty list
        Note over Browser: Dropdown shows "No providers", send disabled
    else Providers found
        Server-->>Browser: List of enabled providers
    end

    User->>Browser: Select provider from dropdown
    Browser->>Server: GET /api/providers/{name}/models
    alt Model discovery fails
        Server-->>Browser: Error
        Note over Browser: Dropdown shows error
    else Success
        Server-->>Browser: Available models
    end

    User->>Browser: Select model
    User->>Browser: Click a rendered diagram to attach
    Note over Browser: Diagram name as removable chip, raw content stored

    User->>Browser: Type review message and click send
    Note over Browser: User message right-aligned, input cleared, loading shown

    Browser->>Server: POST /api/projects/{id}/chat {provider, model, message, attachments}
    alt Invalid provider/model
        Server-->>Browser: 400 with error message
    else Valid request
        Server->>CLI: Invoke CLI with prompt (message + diagram context)
        alt CLI not found or fails to start
            CLI-->>Server: Error
            Server-->>Browser: Error in response
        else CLI running
            loop Stream response tokens
                CLI-->>Server: stdout tokens
                Server-->>Browser: Response tokens
                Note over Browser: AI response renders left-aligned
            end
            alt CLI crashes mid-stream
                CLI-->>Server: Process error
                Server-->>Browser: Error event, partial response preserved
            end
        end
    end
